    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοχ-αστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skilful in aiming at, able to hit</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀρίστου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1141b13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετὴ τοῦ μέσου ς</span>.
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1106b15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς. τῶν φίλων</span>
			<i>consideration for the wishes of . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>proceeding by guesswork</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
			-κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				55e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τέχναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.685
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐπιστῆμαι</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγιοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				59S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. διάγνωσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.365
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζητήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Syrian.
					<u>in Hermog.</u>
					2.34
				</span></i>
			 R.; <i>sagacious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				463a
			</span></i>. Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰ ἔνδοξα -κῶς ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1355a17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς τὸ μέτρον λαμβάνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.360
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς ἐξετάσομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
